  "name": "Oshoro Maru cruise 65 to the Bering Sea and Northwestern North Pacific, Bering Sea and Gulf of Alaska in June - August 1977",
  "description": "Data Record of Oceanographic Observation & Exploratory Fishing - No.21, March 1978 Observation include meteorological observation, hydrographics observation, sampling of water, analysis of water sample, sampling of marine bacteria, plankton sampling, sample of fish larvae, sampling of plankton, sampling of bottom sediment, salmon gill-net and eye observations of sea-birds, whales, etc.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Purpose is to record of Oceanographic Observation & Exploratory Fishing - No.21, March 1978",
